meta {
  name: Get my relationship to a user
  type: http
  seq: 1
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}/me/relationship/{{otherUsername}}
  body: none
  auth: inherit
}

docs {
  Everything the follow button needs: `amIFollowing` and `isMe`.

  A /me route rather than a field on the public profile because it differs per
  viewer and must never be cached. Folding `isMe` in here is what lets the button
  settle "hide entirely" against "show Follow" from one request instead of racing
  two, and it costs nothing because the service already has both profiles loaded.

  - 200 the relationship
  - 401 not logged in
  - 403 authenticated but not onboarded
  - 404 no such username
}
